Package: ROI.plugin.coinclp
Type: Package
Title: 'COIN-OR' 'Clp' Plugin for the 'R' Optimization Infrastructure
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sam", "Lovick", email = "sam@lovickconsulting.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Registers the 'COIN-OR' 'Clp' linear programming solver with
    'ROI', the 'R' Optimization Infrastructure, through the 'coinclp'
    package. Linear programs with continuous variables are then solved by
    'ROI' with the 'coinclp' solver, keeping sparse constraint matrices
    sparse all the way to the solver, and returning dual values, reduced
    costs and row activities alongside the primal solution.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/SamLovick/ROI.plugin.coinclp
